for companies like Wisecrack on the side,

00:11:43.569 --> 00:11:47.480
so it’s really hard for me to commit to
a set time for therapy every week.

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:52.600
My BetterHelp therapist was extremely patient
and understanding about my crazy schedule.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.449
She was also really accessible and responsive.

00:11:54.449 --> 00:11:58.139
One of the best parts about BetterHelp is
that you don’t HAVE to talk to your therapist

00:11:58.139 --> 00:12:00.730
over video conferencing if you don’t want
to.

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:06.250
Counselors are also available over the phone,
messaging and live chat.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.380
You can talk to them from your garage or bed
or just WHEREVER - and it’s all completely

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:11.410
confidential.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:15.629
We all KNOW we should make mental health a
priority, but getting over the stigma or just

00:12:15.629 --> 00:12:17.410
finding the time can be super challenging.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:21.689
So if you’ve been thinking about talking
to a therapist, consider checking out BetterHelp

00:12:21.689 --> 00:12:27.859
at betterhelp.com/wisecrack1 or click the
link in the description below.

